<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13018" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπολάμπω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>shine</i> or <i>beam from,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰχμῆς ἀπέλαμπ᾽ εὐήκεος</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῶς</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				22.319
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				1009
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀστὴρ ὣς ἀπέλαμπεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					6.295
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				15.108
			</span></i>: —
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χάρις ἀπελάμπετο</span>
			grace <i>beamed from</i> her, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				14.183
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				18.298
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρυσοῦ ἀπολάμπεται</span>
			<i>gleams with</i> gold, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Syr.D.</u>
				30
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>reflect light,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				2p.51U.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> c. acc. cogn., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐγὴν ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Dom.</u>
					8
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀστραπῆς κάλλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Callistr.
					<u>Stat.</u>
					5
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεῖόν τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>Im.</u>
					1.16
				</span></i>
			.</div>
